24ng|n|Farthest; most remote in space or time; extreme; last; final. ; Last in a train of progression or consequences; tended toward by all that precedes; arrived at, as the last result; final. ; Incapable of further analysis; incapable of further division or separation; constituent; elemental; as, an ultimate constituent of matter.	n:17l6,99,7~17l6,99,7
